<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Language Sample</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Appendix A Language Sample ‣ Evaluating Morphological Alignment of Tokenizers in 70 Languages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> reports the number of items for each language after filtering and the UD treebank used to create the dataset for that language.
The versions of each treebank that are used are reported in the Hugging Face README: <a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/catherinearnett/morphscore" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://huggingface.co/datasets/catherinearnett/morphscore</a>.</p>
